0067: def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
0068:     """Repeat each colored motif from the end of a grey ruler bar to fill the rectangle beside that bar.
0069: 
0070:     Input structure
0071:     A black-background grid contains one or more straight grey bars.  Each bar is
0072:     either vertical, with a colored rectangular motif attached to its lower-right
0073:     end, or horizontal, with a colored rectangular motif attached below its
0074:     left end.
0075:     Rule
0076:     For a vertical grey bar, repeat the attached motif upward/downward along the
0077:     bar's rows and paint the rectangle immediately to the bar's right.  For a
0078:     horizontal grey bar, repeat the attached motif left/right along the bar's
0079:     columns and paint the rectangle immediately below the bar.
0080:     Key insight
0081:     The grey bar gives the repeat length; the non-grey motif touching one end of
0082:     the bar gives the tile to copy.
